--[[
    NELY HUB UI
    ================================================================

    A ground-up interface library for Nely Hub. Not a restyle of Nely Lib
    v3 and not an evolution of Nely X -- a different layout model.

    WHAT MAKES IT DIFFERENT

    * CARD LAYOUT, NOT A LIST. Controls live inside titled group cards
      that flow across two columns, so a dense tab reads as a handful of
      small panels instead of forty stacked rows. A section in the calling
      code becomes a card; nothing has to be rewritten to get it.

    * ICON RAIL. The sidebar is glyphs only, with the tab name arriving as
      a tooltip on hover. It gives the content roughly 150px back on a
      phone, which is most of a second column.

    * REAL BACKGROUND BLUR. Roblox has no backdrop-blur for GUI, so the
      blur is applied to the 3D scene through Lighting while the window is
      open and animated away on close. It is owned by the window and dies
      with it, so it can never be left behind over someone's game.

    * THEMES ARE LIVE. Every themed instance registers what it uses, so
      SetTheme repaints the running interface instead of asking for a
      reload.

    * ITEM GRIDS. Cards of real artwork with badges, for picking a thing
      by its picture rather than by remembering its name.

    API is source-compatible with Nely Lib v3 -- an existing hub only
    changes its loadstring.

    Plain ASCII only. Executors that read the file as latin-1 turn smart
    punctuation into mojibake inside visible labels.
]]

